<a href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig\">Lake.BuildConfig</a></span>, <span id=\"Lake.BuildContext.toContext\"><a href=\"./Lake/Config/Context.html#Lake.Context\">Lake.Context</a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A Lake context with a build configuration and additional build data. ","docLink":"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildContext","kind":"structure","line":85,"name":"Lake.BuildContext","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/lake/Lake/Build/Context.lean#L85-L101"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.mkJobQueue\"><span class=\"name\">Lake</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkJobQueue</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/System/IO.html#BaseIO\">BaseIO</a> <a href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.JobQueue\">JobQueue</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns a new empty job queue. ","docLink":"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.mkJobQueue","kind":"def","line":81,"name":"Lake.mkJobQueue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/lake/Lake/Build/Context.lean#L81-L83"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.JobQueue\"><span class=\"name\">Lake</span>.<span class=\"name\">JobQueue</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Mutable reference of registered build jobs. ","docLink":"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.JobQueue","kind":"def","line":77,"name":"Lake.JobQueue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/lake/Lake/Build/Context.lean#L77-L79"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig.showProgress\"><span class=\"name\">Lake</span>.<span class=\"name\">BuildConfig</span>.<span class=\"name\">showProgress</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cfg</span> : <a href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig\">BuildConfig</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Whether the build should show progress information.\n\n`Verbosity.quiet` hides progress and, for a `noBuild`,\n`Verbosity.verbose` shows progress.\n","docLink":"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig.showProgress","kind":"def","line":68,"name":"Lake.BuildConfig.showProgress","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/lake/Lake/Build/Context.lean#L68-L75"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig.macosxDeploymentTarget?\"><span class=\"name\">Lake</span>.<span class=\"name\">BuildConfig</span>.<span class=\"name\">macosxDeploymentTarget?</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig\">BuildConfig</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The miniumum OS version to target on MacOS.\n\nIf a minimum is not set, linkers default the minimum to the host major version and\nwill emit warnings if any lineed libraries (including system libraries) exceed the minium.\nThus, the linker will complain when building on a system with an unset minimum and system\nlibraries which require a higher minor version.\n\n```\nld64.lld: warning: /usr/lib/system/libsystem_kernel.dylib has version 13.5.0, which is newer than target minimum of 13.0.0\n```\n\nTo silence such warnings, Lake sets this far into the future by default (e.g., `99.0`).\nHowever, that itself can be wrong if a consumer of Lean library uses the minimum OS version\nto determine compatibility (e.g., Python does this). The far-flung version would then\nimply zero compatibility.\n\nIn such cases, the desired deployment target can be manually specified . Depending on\nthe desired scope, it can be set per-target, for all targets within a buld (with this),\nor across all builds with the environment variable `MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET`.\n","docLink":"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig.macosxDeploymentTarget?","kind":"def","line":66,"name":"Lake.BuildConfig.macosxDeploymentTarget?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/lake/Lake/Build/Context.lean#L66-L66"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig.leanOptOverrides\"><span class=\"name\">Lake</span>.<span class=\"name\">BuildConfig</span>.<span class=\"name\">leanOptOverrides</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig\">BuildConfig</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/NameMap/Basic.html#Lean.NameMap\">Lean.NameMap</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Util/LeanOptions.html#Lean.LeanOptions\">Lean.LeanOptions</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Per-package Lean option overrides, applied to every module whose owning\npackage's `baseName` appears as a key. When `recFetchSetup` builds module\n`M`, the `LeanOptions` associated with `M.pkg.baseName` (if any) are appended\nto `M.leanOptions`, overriding clashing entries.\n\nUsed by `lake lint` to inject `linter.extra`/`linter.all` into every module\nof a target package (so transitively-imported first-party modules capture\nlinter-tagged warnings), without touching dependencies.\n","docLink":"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig.leanOptOverrides","kind":"def","line":44,"name":"Lake.BuildConfig.leanOptOverrides","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/lake/Lake/Build/Context.lean#L44-L44"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig.outputsIdx\"><span class=\"name\">Lake</span>.<span class=\"name\">BuildConfig</span>.<span class=\"name\">outputsIdx</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig\">BuildConfig</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"When tracking input-to-output mappings, the workspace index of the tracked package. ","docLink":"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig.outputsIdx","kind":"def","line":33,"name":"Lake.BuildConfig.outputsIdx","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/lake/Lake/Build/Context.lean#L33-L33"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lake/Build/Context.html#Lake.BuildConfig.outputsFile?\"><span class=\"name\">Lake</span>.<span class=\"name\">BuildConfig</span>.<span class=\"name\"